    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d243">

                <pb facs="0577" n="493" sameAs="frus:frus1886/pg493"/>

                <head>No. 239.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Messrs. Cushing and McKenney to Mr.
                        Bayard.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Portland, Me.</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1886-04-09"><hi rendition="#italic">April</hi> 9</date>. [Received
                        April 9.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>Having several fishing vessels ready for the Banks, we desire to know if they can
                    call at Canadian ports for men and be protected in so doing.</p>
                <closer><signed>CUSHING &amp; McKENNEY.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
